    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This beautifully presented two-bedroom, two-bathroom property is ideally located in the sought-after Glenhilton development in Bray.\r\n\r\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, the property offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation with a stylish and welcoming finish. The spacious layout provides two comfortable bedrooms, including a main bedroom with ensuite, along with a well-appointed main newly fitted bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe property also benefits from designated parking, adding further convenience for residents.\r\n\r\nSet in a desirable location close to Bray town centre, the seafront and a wide range of local amenities, this attractive home offers an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, investors or those looking for a well-maintained property in a popular area.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Secure parking\r\nBeautifully presented\r\nViews of the mountains\r\nNew bathroom\r\nNew flooring throughout\r\nConvenient location close to Bray town centre and amenities\r\nElectric heating \r\nManagement fees €1,550 per annum\r\n\r\nBER: 115591489"
      },
